--- !u!114 &571405668
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 571405666}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4e5a3e0c93b70c43a4a4c80fb87cd8e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PagePanelController
  leftPages:
  - "SCHOOL VIOLENCE? COVER UP? WHAT'S THE TRUTH?\n\nA 19 year old boy named XXX
    hung himself in his school bathroom on the second floor. Students spread rumors
    of him being bullied but there was no proof. Shortly after, his mother also passed
    away in grief. Is this a coincidence or a cover up of school violence?\_"
  - "JOURNAL \n\nWe have been investigating our child\u2019s death for almost a year
    now. XXX\u2019s mom passed away last week, it was just too much for her. But
    I will find my son's killer no matter what.\nTom was highly suspected of bullying
    our child, but we don\u2019t have enough evidence to confirm our suspicion. He
    died around 4 months after my son's death. Could it be related?\_"
  rightPages:
  - "STUDENT DEATH RECORD\n\nOn the boy's body, there were several burn marks and
    grotesque bruises. He was also severly malnourished. As much as these could be
    proof of violence, they can also be forms of self harm. Neither can be proven
    with the information we have.\_"
  - "Tom died in the school bathroom, just like my son. He died from what was said
    to be a heart attack. The doctor said that the heart attack may be caused by
    fear, but fear of what? He only had one wound, his eyes were dug out. But there
    was no signs of anyone else nor were there any struggles, so did he dug them
    out himself? Did he feel guilty for what he he did or could this be some sort
    of revenge?\_"
  leftPageText: {fileID: 667670092}
  rightPageText: {fileID: 1395071150}
  pageNumberText: {fileID: 378019383}
  panel: {fileID: 571405666}
